    "title": "Senior Fleet Manager at TransIndia Logistics South Asia Partners",
    "description": "TransIndia Logistics South Asia Partners, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Fleet Manager for our Chennai operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout TransIndia Logistics South Asia Partners:\nTransIndia Logistics South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Coordinate with warehousing teams for inbound and outbound operations\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• BPharm / MPharm / PharmD\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in INCOTERMS\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Referral bonus program\n• Learning & development budget\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with TransIndia Logistics South Asia Partners!",
